OL,3,GNEWSAKing Charles praises Welsh 'sense
OL,4,Aof belonging' as he opens Senedd
OL,5,
OL,6,FKing Charles III has praised Welsh
OL,7,Fpeople's "sense of belonging", as he
OL,8,Fand Queen Camilla officially opened the
OL,9,FSenedd's seventh term.
OL,11,FThe visit marked the King's first
OL,12,Fofficial meeting with First Minister
OL,13,FRhun ap Iorwerth following the Senedd
OL,14,Felection victory of Plaid Cymru - a
OL,15,Fparty rooted in a strong republican
OL,16,Ftradition.
OL,18,FWales' national poet did not take part
OL,19,Fin ceremony as had been planned, after
OL,20,FSenedd officials rejected the poem she
OL,21,Fhad written for the event and cancelled
OL,22,Fher performance.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
