OL,3,GNEWSAKing Charles praises Welsh 'sense
OL,4,Aof belonging' as he opens Senedd
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 30 anti-monarchy protesters by
OL,7,Fthe steps of the Senedd were vocal
OL,8,Fthroughout the royal visit, and one
OL,9,Fprotester was removed from the area in
OL,10,Fhandcuffs and led away by police.
